♪ That I'm happy for you ♪

00:12:57.100 --> 00:12:58.400
[ Laughs ]

00:12:58.400 --> 00:13:06.534
♪ I wish nothing but
the best for you both ♪

00:13:06.534 --> 00:13:08.834
♪ An older version of me ♪

00:13:08.834 --> 00:13:11.000
♪ Is she perverted like me? ♪

00:13:11.000 --> 00:13:14.868
♪ Would she go down on you
in a theater? ♪

00:13:14.868 --> 00:13:17.601
♪ Does she speak eloquently? ♪

00:13:17.601 --> 00:13:19.567
♪ And would she
have your baby? ♪

00:13:19.567 --> 00:13:23.901
♪ I'm sure she'd make
a really excellent mother ♪

00:13:23.901 --> 00:13:26.133
♪ 'Cause the love that you gave
that we made ♪

00:13:26.133 --> 00:13:28.267
♪ Wasn't able to make it
enough for you ♪

00:13:28.267 --> 00:13:33.334
♪ To be open wide, no ♪

00:13:33.334 --> 00:13:35.267
♪ And every time
you speak her name ♪

00:13:35.267 --> 00:13:36.567
♪ Does she know
how you told me ♪

00:13:36.567 --> 00:13:38.567
♪ You'd hold me
until you died? ♪

00:13:38.567 --> 00:13:41.267
♪ Till you died,
but you're still alive ♪

00:13:41.267 --> 00:13:45.734
♪ And I'm here to remind you ♪

00:13:45.734 --> 00:13:50.000
♪ Of the mess you left
when you went away ♪

00:13:50.000 --> 00:13:54.567
♪ It's not fair to deny me ♪

00:13:54.567 --> 00:13:58.434
♪ Of the cross I bear
that you gave to me ♪

00:13:58.434 --> 00:14:01.801
♪ You, you, you oughta know ♪

00:14:01.801 --> 00:14:03.334
-Thank you very much,
everybody.

00:14:03.334 --> 00:14:05.033
Happy holidays!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:14:05.033 --> 00:14:09.467
Alanis Morissette!
Thank you, New York City!

